---
---

<section class="section spaces" id="spaces">
	<div class="wrap sp-grid">
		<div class="sp-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow reveal">Spaces</p>
			<h2 class="section-title reveal">A clipboard you can share.</h2>
			<p class="section-lead reveal">
				A Space is a live, shared feed between any number of people. Share a clip or a
				note into it and everyone sees it in seconds, still end-to-end encrypted with a
				key the server never holds.
			</p>
			<ul class="sp-list reveal">
				<li>
					<b>Invite your way.</b> A code, a link that works for people without the app,
					or an email. People can also ask to join, and any member can let them in.
				</li>
				<li>
					<b>Auto-copy incoming.</b> Turn it on per space and shared items land straight
					on your clipboard as they arrive.
				</li>
				<li>
					<b>Send filters, off by default.</b> Auto-share only the content, types or
					groups you choose. Until you do, only items you share by hand go in.
				</li>
				<li>
					<b>Talk about it in place.</b> Comment on anything shared into a space, with
					mentions.
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div class="sp-demo reveal" aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="feed">
				<div class="feed-head">
					<span class="feed-name">design-team</span>
					<span class="feed-count">4 members</span>
				</div>
				<div class="feed-item">
					<div class="fi-top"><span class="who" style="--ac:#a855f7">R</span><span class="fi-name">rio</span><span class="fi-time">2m</span></div>
					<div class="fi-body mono">#ff3e1c on #0e0e0e, ratio 4.6:1</div>
					<div class="fi-foot"><span class="oc-chip" style="--cc:var(--kind-text)">Text</span><span class="fi-cmt">2 comments</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="feed-item">
					<div class="fi-top"><span class="who" style="--ac:#14b8a6">M</span><span class="fi-name">mei</span><span class="fi-time">9m</span></div>
					<div class="fi-thumb"></div>
					<div class="fi-foot"><span class="oc-chip" style="--cc:var(--kind-image)">Image</span></div>
				</div>
				<div class="feed-item ghost">
					<div class="fi-top"><span class="who" style="--ac:#3b82f6">S</span><span class="fi-name">sam</span><span class="fi-time">now</span></div>
					<div class="fi-body mono">staging.rovertools.app/preview</div>
					<div class="fi-foot"><span class="oc-chip" style="--cc:var(--kind-url)">URL</span><span class="fi-new">arrived</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.spaces {
	}

	.sp-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.sp-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.9rem;
	}

	.sp-list li {
		font-size: 0.94rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
		padding-left: 1.1rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.sp-list li::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0.5em;
		width: 6px;
		height: 6px;
		border-radius: 2px;
		background: var(--accent);
	}

	.sp-list b {
		color: var(--text);
	}

	.feed {
		background: var(--sidebar-bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 0.9rem;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
	}

	.feed-head {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: baseline;
		margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
		padding: 0 0.2rem;
	}

	.feed-name {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.feed-count {
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.feed-item {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
		padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
	}

	.feed-item.ghost {
		border-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.fi-top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
	}

	.who {
		width: 18px;
		height: 18px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-size: 0.58rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #fff;
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ac) 75%, #000);
	}

	.fi-name {
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.fi-time {
		margin-left: auto;
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.fi-body {
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		white-space: nowrap;
		overflow: hidden;
		text-overflow: ellipsis;
	}

	.mono {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}

	.fi-thumb {
		height: 54px;
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		background:
			linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(20, 184, 166, 0.45), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3)),
			var(--surface-hover);
		border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
	}

	.fi-foot {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin-top: 0.45rem;
	}

	.fi-cmt {
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.fi-new {
		margin-left: auto;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.6rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		background: var(--accent-dim);
		padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 9px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.sp-grid {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}
	}
</style>
